{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113644016776392706"]}, "author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-23T14:52:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113644769981108304"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 51, "id": "258157507", "start": 37, "username": "jeannasmialek"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/XWpYanuKGa", "end": 298, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2113644769981108304/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113644016776392706", "start": 275, "url": "https://t.co/XWpYanuKGa"}, {"display_url": "x.com/tracyalloway/s…", "end": 322, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/tracyalloway/status/2113632538157789391", "start": 299, "url": "https://t.co/WVmSW1apCE"}]}, "id": "2113644769981108304", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 9338, "like_count": 33, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113632538157789391", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "It was so wonderful catching up with @jeannasmialek, who we hardly ever see anymore since she left the Fed beat and decamped to Europe.\n\nDuring our conversation, I suddenly remembered that in 2002, Russell Roberts (host of the EconTalk podcast) also wrote a a romance novel. https://t.co/XWpYanuKGa https://t.co/WVmSW1apCE", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2113644769981108304"}, {"author_id": "497231011", "created_at": "2026-10-23T14:47:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113643514395250867"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/caixin/status/…", "end": 57, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/caixin/status/2113576162886631767", "start": 34, "url": "https://t.co/LQFDSaLu4R"}]}, "id": "2113643514395250867", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1339, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113576162886631767", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "If only there was a better option https://t.co/LQFDSaLu4R", "url": "https://x.com/ChinaBeigeBook/status/2113643514395250867"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-23T14:41:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113642013497385246"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/TheStalwart/st…", "end": 289, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/TheStalwart/status/2113394106160251177", "start": 266, "url": "https://t.co/ePU6Eg1BKe"}]}, "id": "2113642013497385246", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 15524, "like_count": 129, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 6}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113394106160251177", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "The Tompkins Square basketball courts/exercise bars is as positive/wholesome/diverse public space as you're going to find anywhere. If you care about a thriving, healthy (spiritually, physically etc.) East Village, please attend Tuesday's community meeting with me. https://t.co/ePU6Eg1BKe", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2113642013497385246"}, {"author_id": "497231011", "created_at": "2026-10-23T14:32:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113639781825483212"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 7, "start": 1, "tag": "China"}, {"end": 60, "start": 51, "tag": "outbound"}]}, "id": "2113639781825483212", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 1188, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\"#China has unveiled a revised rule for regulating #outbound investment, requiring investors to report major adverse developments more diligently, including foreign demands to hand over technology or dispose of stakes. \n\nThe new rule, announced by the NDRC on Thurs, aims to", "url": "https://x.com/ChinaBeigeBook/status/2113639781825483212"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-23T14:05:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113632953549136222"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/leleluax/statu…", "end": 129, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/leleluax/status/2112195581095682048", "start